# app: whatsapp
# Sending: New message with two favourites (a list to pick from), then a send the script refuses (fixture ha-down.example.test
# answers "too_soon"): a toast with the reason, and the text stays in the field.
wait 1500
tap 140 918             # New message
wait 900
shot whatsapp-favorites
tap 270 210             # Family
wait 900
type Hi all
wait 600
tap 400 504             # Send
wait 900
tap 270 812             # Send in the sheet
wait 1500
expect-state chars=6
shot whatsapp-send-refused
